cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this system, please cite it as below."
title: "Multimodal Biometric System"
abstract: >-
  A desktop biometric system for enrolment, 1:1 verification and 1:N
  identification by fingerprint, face and voice, built as Stage B of the
  fingerprint-level3-recognition-research project. Its fingerprint methods
  come from that research and run on native 1000 ppi captures.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Michael
    family-names: Sirkovich
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mish2000/multimodal-biometric-system"
license-url: "https://github.com/Mish2000/multimodal-biometric-system/blob/main/LICENSE"
keywords:
  - biometrics
  - multimodal biometrics
  - fingerprint
  - level 3 features
  - sweat pores
